### 3.3 Acceptance checklist

- [x] Nested `describe` reuses existing harness boot (`createApp` + `attachStreamManager`)
- [x] 5 iterations measured with `process.hrtime.bigint()` from `POST /api/chat` dispatch
- [x] Captures first `option_update` and journey `COMPLETED`
- [x] Asserts `p50 ≤ 250 ms`, `max ≤ 1000 ms`
- [x] Assertion message prints p50/max + all samples
- [x] Injection of `await setTimeout(1500)` at top of `executeSurface` fails at `p50 ≈ 1508 ms`, then reverted
